<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white">The Story Behind AI-Recommendable</h2>
<p class="mt-4 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">Mo Rahman founded AI-Recommendable because he saw a gap that most businesses don't even know exists.</p>
<p class="mt-4 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">When people ask ChatGPT, Gemini or Perplexity for a recommendation — "find me a good plumber in London" or "recommend an accountant near me" — the AI picks a handful of businesses and ignores the rest. Most business owners have no idea whether they're being chosen or skipped.</p>
<p class="mt-4 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">That's the problem he set out to solve. Not with hype, not with jargon — but with clear, practical steps and robust technology that actually move the needle.</p>
<p class="mt-4 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">The AI Visibility Report and AI Readiness Assessment are the starting points. From there, everything is tailored to what the business actually needs — no retainer traps, no unnecessary upsells.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
