<h3 class="font-bold text-white">Digital Strategy & AI Visibility</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">Mo Rahman brings 20+ years of sales, marketing and SEO experience, helping businesses understand how they appear — and don't appear — in AI-powered search and recommendations. Combining proven digital marketing expertise with emerging AI visibility strategies, he helps businesses identify the trust signals, authority factors and online presence that can influence whether they're recommended by AI.</p>
