<h3 class="font-bold text-white">AI Readiness & Business Transformation</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">Beyond visibility — helping businesses build the strategy, skills, data and governance needed to adopt AI effectively across their entire organisation. Practical, not theoretical.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-950 p-6">
