<div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-white">Research-Led Approach</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">I don't guess. Every recommendation is backed by real research — analysing how AI platforms actually behave, what signals they prioritise, and what's changing as the technology evolves. The AI Recommendation Observatory exists to track this.</p>
